  "details": "Some users' icons appear not cropped correctly in the Here tab. As you can see in the attached image, clipping does not take place. This icon should be cropped round, but for some reason, it is not.\n\nI think it's an accidental bug caused by the recycle view and the image format of this icon, but I'm not sure...\n\n**Misc Info**\n\n* Build Number: 1519\n\n* Platform: PC\n\n* Ease to Reproduce: Difficult\n\n  * I found this bug in Japan Street, but this bug only occurred with this user ながみねん. It happens sometimes when I open and close tabs (around 50% to 70 % probability).",
